  duration_ms: 5003.075083
  type: 'test'
  ...
# Subtest: retry helper: a ModelCallFailedError on the last attempt is re-thrown as a ModelCallFailedError with the attempt prefix
ok 90 - retry helper: a ModelCallFailedError on the last attempt is re-thrown as a ModelCallFailedError with the attempt prefix
  ---
  duration_ms: 0.888
  type: 'test'
  ...
