ok 91 - retry helper: a shape failure on the last attempt stays a plain Error even after an earlier failed call
  ---
  duration_ms: 0.163959
  type: 'test'
  ...
# Subtest: OllamaProvider: a cancelled call (AbortError) reaches the caller as it was raised, on the call and during iteration, and is not taken for a failed model call
ok 92 - OllamaProvider: a cancelled call (AbortError) reaches the caller as it was raised, on the call and during iteration, and is not taken for a failed model call
  ---
  duration_ms: 7.617167
  type: 'test'
  ...
